{"id":10048,"name":"houndoom-mega","speciesId":229,"dex":229,"form":"mega","generation":2,"types":["dark","fire"],"stats":{"hp":75,"attack":90,"defense":90,"special-attack":140,"special-defense":90,"speed":115},"abilities":[{"name":"solar-power","hidden":false}],"height":19,"weight":495,"baseExp":210,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10048.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10048.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10048.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10048.ogg","genus":"Dark Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"gold","text":"If you are burned by the flames it shoots from its mouth, the pain will never go away."},{"version":"silver","text":"Upon hearing its eerie howls, other POKéMON get the shivers and head straight back to their nests."},{"version":"crystal","text":"The pungent- smelling flame that shoots from its mouth results from toxins burn­ ing in its body."},{"version":"ruby","text":"In a HOUNDOOM pack, the one with its horns raked sharply towards the back serves a leadership role. These POKéMON choose their leader by fighting amongst themselves."},{"version":"emerald","text":"In a HOUNDOOM pack, the one with its horns raked sharply back serves a leadership role. They choose their leader by fighting among themselves."},{"version":"diamond","text":"Long ago, people imagined its eerie howls to be the call of the grim reaper."},{"version":"platinum","text":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"Upon hearing its eerie howls, other Pokémon get the shivers and head straight back to their nests."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"In a Houndoom pack, the one with its horns raked sharply toward the back serves a leadersh